<metadata><name>Day 15 (stop 1 of 2) - Fisher's Pond</name></metadata>
<wpt lat="43.388387" lon="-79.854327"><name>P Start/finish parking</name><desc>Roadside parking where the Trail crosses Guelph Line, south of No 1 Sideroad. Free</desc><sym>Parking Area</sym></wpt>
<wpt lat="43.377040" lon="-79.859836"><name>J1</name><desc>J1: Turn right onto the blue-blazed Fisher's Pond Side Trail, heading north-west. (the white-blazed main Bruce Trail goes off on your left.)</desc><sym>Waypoint</sym></wpt>
